Origin
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Forge Super is a rebuild of the "Zed edition" of Forge Super, which was a fork
of the Zed editor (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed). Its window layout
follows Zed's. "Zed" is a trademark of Zed Industries, Inc.; this product is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Zed Industries.

The UI is built on Mentenaz.GPUI (https://github.com/mentenaz/Mentenaz.GPUI),
which contains:
  - gpui and related crates, Copyright Zed Industries, Inc., Apache-2.0
  - gpui-component, Copyright Longbridge, Apache-2.0
  - gpui-flow, Copyright Adib, MIT
Their licence texts ship with Mentenaz.GPUI.

Third-party Rust dependencies are under their own licences (MIT, Apache-2.0,
BSD, ISC, Zlib, MPL-2.0 and similar); see each crate's metadata.

